							<strong>King of Digital Marketing™ is a premier full-service digital agency and a registered unit of Devweboic Techsolutions (OPC) Pvt. Ltd.</strong> We appreciate your confidence in our capabilities and thank you for choosing our digital marketing, web engineering, PPC, SEO, and consulting solutions at <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com">kingofdigitalmarketing.com</a>.
						</p>

						<p class="kdm-intro-body-text">
							Unlike tangible retail goods, digital marketing and growth consulting involve substantial upfront investment of intellectual property, senior strategist hours, comprehensive multi-channel planning, custom technical audits, and dedicated team bandwidth allocation long before live campaigns go active. To establish absolute transparency and protect both parties, this policy outlines our project cancellation terms, our 24-hour review window, and the precise breakdown of our <strong>75% strategy planning and onboarding compensation deduction</strong> applied on eligible cancellations.
						</p>

