							<div class="kdm-callout-content">
								<h4 class="kdm-callout-title">24-Hour Cancellation Window & 75% Strategy Planning Compensation</h4>
								<p class="kdm-callout-text">
									Clients have a strict window of <strong>24 hours from the exact timestamp of initial payment</strong> to submit a formal written cancellation request. For verified cancellation requests approved within this 24-hour window, <strong>75% of the total project cost/initial invoice amount is retained as non-refundable compensation</strong> to cover extensive pre-onboarding consultation sessions, multi-level strategy architecture, competitive intelligence, senior consultant hours, and team bandwidth reservation. The remaining <strong>25% balance</strong> will be refunded to the original payment source. Once the 24-hour window expires or project execution begins, payments become strictly non-refundable.
								</p>
